om retaliation after they report a  suspected violation of law and in this  case that's exactly what Heidi  she reported and then she was terminated  most whistleblower cases settled but  globe wanted to take this case to court  while awaiting trial heidi says she was  followed at night in another incident  the windows of her car were shot out in  her driveway the bullet went through the  driver's side and exited the back window  Heidi reported those incidents to police  they were never connected in any way to  Globe University it was scary it was  stressful so stressful  Alex Ferreira is with us now Alex what  is Heidi Weber doing now what happened  to her  well she's contemplating her next career  move she says she was blackballed in the  education industry and can't get a job  there so she went actually from being  the Dean of the medical assistant  program at globe back to being a medical  assistant herself and now she's she's  looking to see what her next move will  be all right Alex Ferreira will look  forward to that to me thanks so much for  having me thank you you can see the full  story tonight on the season finale of  The Whistleblower it airs at 9:00 8:00  central here on CBS
 

